{"id":"conv_04413","context":"A rural local guides a uni reporter through a heritage site","ambient":"street_quiet_distant","cast":["tatsuya_country","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"tatsuya_country","mood":null,"en":"Welcome, this is our village's World Heritage site. That old tower is the main attraction.","jp":"ようこそ、ここがうちの村の世界遺産じゃ。あの古い塔が一番の見どころでな。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,6,12,21,132,133,149,268,341,343,1189,1641,4428,4724,9934,16874],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ようこそ","w":9934},{"s":"、"},{"s":"ここ","w":133},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"うち","w":268},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"村","r":"むら","w":1189},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"世界","r":"せかい","w":149},{"s":"遺産","r":"いさん","w":4428},{"s":"じゃ","w":132},{"s":"。"},{"s":"あの","w":341},{"s":"古い","r":"ふるい","w":1641},{"s":"塔","r":"とう","w":4724},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"一番","r":"いちばん","w":343},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"見どころ","r":"みどころ","w":16874},{"s":"で","w":21},{"s":"な","w":12},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"It's so impressive. Is it true that heaven and hell are painted inside the tower?","jp":"すごい迫力ですね。塔の中の絵に天国と地獄が描かれてるって本当ですか?","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,6,9,16,17,51,55,58,100,139,1045,1171,1206,1999,2952,3324,4538,4724,4875,4885,5964,6221,15003,17334],"jpTokens":[{"s":"すごい","w":1206},{"s":"迫力","r":"はくりょく","w":6221},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"},{"s":"塔","r":"とう","w":4724},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"中","r":"なか","w":55},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"絵","r":"え","w":1045},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"天国","r":"てんごく","w":4885},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"地獄","r":"じごく","w":4538},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"描か","r":"えがか","w":3324},{"s":"れ","w":58},{"s":"てる","w":139},{"s":"って","w":100},{"s":"本当","r":"ほんとう","w":1171},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"?"}]},{"speaker":"tatsuya_country","mood":null,"en":"That's right. Angels on the right, devils on the left. You can feel the old faith.","jp":"そうじゃ。右側に天使、左側に悪魔がおってな。昔の人の信仰が伝わってくる。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,6,12,30,61,132,184,361,665,3